        "payload": "tree 3a7b7013c77623b758b5772df0a9ae903d0cbf33\nparent 649bc0a645eb127a9b1e6d078f8d129be6380c87\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792040361 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792040361 +0200\n\nvalidation: check the sigops limit before staging a transaction\n\nPreChecks stages a transaction in the mempool changeset before it\nchecks MAX_STANDARD_TX_SIGOPS_COST. With a large -bytespersigop, the\nsigop-adjusted weight of a transaction over that limit does not fit in\nthe int32_t size TxGraph uses, so staging it fails\nAssume(feerate.size > 0) in TxGraphImpl::AddTransaction, and debug\nbuilds abort.\n\nCheck the limit right after counting the sigops, before staging.\n",
